      "hasMediaInOriginal": true,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "Pixel Recorder app will automatically generate transcripts for your recordings in the cloud. \n\nWith the new update to version 4.2.20241220, the app has received an 'Auto transcribe' option for audio files copied to the cloud with missing transcript. This feature builds on the previously added “Transcribe again” feature, which transcribes text using cloud-based algorithms rather than local device models. \n\nThe feature is part of the March Pixel Feature Drop and is available for Pixel 6 and newer. \n\n😎 Google News | En",
