        {
          "id": "video-1",
          "kind": "video",
          "url": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/b394f1fbd6.mp4?token=BhM4id2-dyYsjUNZ7OtL41oYSOEBRBnXmeDHqpyOU7D4xTgPyrr8yBG3yleULE1dxghR8B2Gcq8ra0eqiyIQg-jXvv0V_1uBAyFPGShd9GLpaj1NzV1Da4DDaYVeA58EUFuPsF3pPsYC2RPiXa1pLMggjd0CeIiuydjbBjl8Rt2mUB1HtEC3NrF8YbPb0_mPfKL0TmxauBZn-JRAbQc1egRaVa_4zb3Zak6fE8v3eU27vP-h0Lzs2gpRbpbLkoTuv0kGFzEcoGBAa6rEVYocZOqQkFzq_n-e4Ageg_8zDMiOkxVrh5rVFJIgRkyiQl1i0dCQGX-HcBrIGbtpQRG5lQ",
          "poster": null,
          "mimeType": "video/mp4"
        }
      ],
      "hasMediaInOriginal": true,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "The March 2025 Pixel Feature Drop based on the stable Android 15 QPR2 has been released. \n\nAs always, the quarterly update introduces new features in Google apps in conjunction with the release of Android 15 QPR2. The official list of new features:\n\n• Connected Cameras for the Pixel 9 series - the ability to connect a GoPro HERO10 or Pixel 6 and newer models as external cameras to stream from different angles. \n• Automatic transcribe in Recorder for cloud recordings. \n• Location sharing with trusted contacts in Find My Device. \n• Scam Detection in Google Messages.\n• Scam Detection for calls on the Pixel 9 series with Gemini Nano. \n• Dual-screen preview for video mode for Pixel Fold.\n• Dual-screen preview for Add Me mode for Pixel 9 Pro Fold. \n• Generating images of people in Pixel Studio for the Pixel 9 series. \n• Pixel Screenshots now automatically suggests screenshots to add to your collection. And it's now available in work profiles [Pixel 9 series]\n• Messaging via satellite for Verizon and T-Mobile carriers [Pixel 9 Series]\n• New regions with access to Satellite SOS: Hawaii, Alaska, Europe, and Canada [Pixel 9 Series]\n\nAlso added some new features along with Android 15 QPR2, which will be covered in a separate post. \n\nBuild number: BP1A.250305.020\nSecurity Patch: March 2025\n\nAvailable for Pixel 6 and newer devices.\n\n🔗 Google Announcement\n🔗 Pixel Help Post\n\n🔗 Android Security Bulletin\n🔗 Pixel Update Bulletin\n\n🔗 Factory Images\n🔗 OTA-images\n\n😎 Google News | En",
